INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('c7ba35fa-339b-5f1d-967b-85a39d42900c', 'China Corporate Sustainability Compact for Textile and Apparel Industry', 'Corporate Sustainability Compact for Textile and Apparel Industry (2018) (CSC9000T)', 'The core of this strategic task is to guide textile and apparel enterprises to comprehensively and systematically consider all aspects of their impacts and respond to stakeholders’ interests and expectations in business strategies, systems, operations and relationships, and fulfil their responsibility for society, environment and market order in a scientific, continuous and systemic way, with the aim to respect human rights, improve working conditions, protect the environment, maintain market order, construct fair and effective international supply and value chains, enhance the competitiveness of enterprises and the industry, as well as realize their common sustainable development with the society.', 'The core of this strategic task is to guide textile and apparel enterprises to comprehensively and systematically consider all aspects of their impacts and respond to stakeholders’ interests and expectations in business strategies, systems, operations and relationships, and fulfil their responsibility for society, environment and market order in a scientific, continuous and systemic way, with the aim to respect human rights, improve working conditions, protect the environment, maintain market order, construct fair and effective international supply and value chains, enhance the competitiveness of enterprises and the industry, as well as realize their common sustainable development with the society.', 'The core of this strategic task is to guide textile and apparel enterprises to comprehensively and systematically consider all aspects of their impacts and respond to stakeholders’ interests and expectations in business strategies, systems, operations and relationships, and fulfil their responsibility for society, environment and market order in a scientific, continuous and systemic way, with the aim to respect human rights, improve working conditions, protect the environment, maintain market order, construct fair and effective international supply and value chains, enhance the competitiveness of enterprises and the industry, as well as realize their common sustainable development with the society.', 'China', 'social', 'in_force', '2018-01-01'::date, 'China', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/33_9', ARRAY['sdg8', 'regulations', 'china', 'mandatory', 'sdg16', 'disclosure', 'sdg9']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('0e71471f-1416-500d-b9c5-23ab3d82af37', 'China Overall plan for the establishment of green finance', 'Overall plan for the establishment of green finance reform and innovation pilot zones in five provinces', 'This plan comprises several aims: To build a green financial service system with a perfect organisational system, rich products and services, and complete infrastructure will be built, and the coverage, accessibility and satisfaction of green financial services will be greatly enhanced. To form a green financial service system with strong influence; To gradually increase the proportion of green credit, green bonds and green equity financing in the scale of social financing in the pilot area; To carry out green financial innovation and explore through innovation in the areas of system, organisation, market, products, services and safeguard measures.', 'This plan comprises several aims: To build a green financial service system with a perfect organisational system, rich products and services, and complete infrastructure will be built, and the coverage, accessibility and satisfaction of green financial services will be greatly enhanced. To form a green financial service system with strong influence; To gradually increase the proportion of green credit, green bonds and green equity financing in the scale of social financing in the pilot area; To carry out green financial innovation and explore through innovation in the areas of system, organisation, market, products, services and safeguard measures.', 'This plan comprises several aims: To build a green financial service system with a perfect organisational system, rich products and services, and complete infrastructure will be built, and the coverage, accessibility and satisfaction of green financial services will be greatly enhanced. To form a green financial service system with strong influence; To gradually increase the proportion of green credit, green bonds and green equity financing in the scale of social financing in the pilot area; To carry out green financial innovation and explore through innovation in the areas of system, organisation, market, products, services and safeguard measures.', 'China', 'climate', 'in_force', '2017-01-01'::date, 'China', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/33_19', ARRAY['sdg2', 'sdg7', 'china', 'mandatory', 'mandatory_regulations', 'sdg15', 'disclosure', 'sdg9']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('7f2a1a89-a9bf-51a0-96e3-cb24a89d55af', 'China Business Guidelines for Green Debt Financing Instruments', 'Business Guidelines for Green Debt Financing Instruments of Non-Financial Enterprises', 'These guidelines set out to promote the construction of a green financial system, mobilize and guide more social capital to invest in green industries, support the green, circular and low-carbon development of non-financial enterprises, and regulate the issuance of green debt financing instruments by non-financial enterprises.', 'These guidelines set out to promote the construction of a green financial system, mobilize and guide more social capital to invest in green industries, support the green, circular and low-carbon development of non-financial enterprises, and regulate the issuance of green debt financing instruments by non-financial enterprises.', 'These guidelines set out to promote the construction of a green financial system, mobilize and guide more social capital to invest in green industries, support the green, circular and low-carbon development of non-financial enterprises, and regulate the issuance of green debt financing instruments by non-financial enterprises.', 'China', 'climate', 'in_force', '2017-01-01'::date, 'China', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/33_27', ARRAY['guidance_frameworks', 'sdg13', 'sdg7', 'sdg12', 'disclosure', 'china', 'voluntary']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('e21c7337-8b74-582a-bc5c-104c2f2fd874', 'Guiding Opinions of the China Securities Regulatory Commission', 'Guiding Opinions of the China Securities Regulatory Commission on Supporting the Development of Green Bonds', 'This is a guidance pertaining to the adherence to the development concept of innovation, coordination, green, openness and sharing. It is meant to guide the stock exchange bond market to further serve the healthy and orderly development of green industries, and promote the transformation of my country''s economic development mode and economic structure transformation and upgrading.', 'This is a guidance pertaining to the adherence to the development concept of innovation, coordination, green, openness and sharing. It is meant to guide the stock exchange bond market to further serve the healthy and orderly development of green industries, and promote the transformation of my country''s economic development mode and economic structure transformation and upgrading.', 'This is a guidance pertaining to the adherence to the development concept of innovation, coordination, green, openness and sharing. It is meant to guide the stock exchange bond market to further serve the healthy and orderly development of green industries, and promote the transformation of my country''s economic development mode and economic structure transformation and upgrading.', 'China', 'climate', 'in_force', '2017-01-01'::date, 'China', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/33_30', ARRAY['guidance_frameworks', 'sdg13', 'sdg7', 'sdg11', 'china', 'mandatory', 'disclosure', 'sdg9', 'sdg3']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('39874e84-f386-5ae8-82e1-2118bc17f166', 'China National carbon emission trading market construction plan (power', 'National carbon emission trading market construction plan (power generation industry)', 'The National carbon emission trading market construction plan aims to establish a carbon emission rights trading market in China''s power generation industry. It follows the guidance of the Party Central Committee and the State Council to promote ecological civilization and control greenhouse gas emissions. The plan emphasizes market mechanisms to reduce carbon emissions, aligning with the country''s development goals for a green and low-carbon economy. It outlines basic principles, objectives, tasks, and a phased approach to promote the carbon market''s construction and operation.', 'The National carbon emission trading market construction plan aims to establish a carbon emission rights trading market in China''s power generation industry. It follows the guidance of the Party Central Committee and the State Council to promote ecological civilization and control greenhouse gas emissions. The plan emphasizes market mechanisms to reduce carbon emissions, aligning with the country''s development goals for a green and low-carbon economy. It outlines basic principles, objectives, tasks, and a phased approach to promote the carbon market''s construction and operation.', 'The National carbon emission trading market construction plan aims to establish a carbon emission rights trading market in China''s power generation industry. It follows the guidance of the Party Central Committee and the State Council to promote ecological civilization and control greenhouse gas emissions. The plan emphasizes market mechanisms to reduce carbon emissions, aligning with the country''s development goals for a green and low-carbon economy. It outlines basic principles, objectives, tasks, and a phased approach to promote the carbon market''s construction and operation.', 'China', 'climate', 'in_force', '2017-01-01'::date, 'China', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/33_32', ARRAY['sdg13', 'china', 'mandatory', 'mandatory_regulations', 'disclosure', 'sdg9']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('9b12c18d-d0b5-5e2e-9067-7081f373220c', 'China Environmental Protection Tax Law', 'Environmental Protection Tax Law of the People''s Republic of China', 'This law is enacted in order to protect and improve the environment, reduce pollutant emissions and promote the construction of ecological civilization.', 'This law is enacted in order to protect and improve the environment, reduce pollutant emissions and promote the construction of ecological civilization.', 'This law is enacted in order to protect and improve the environment, reduce pollutant emissions and promote the construction of ecological civilization.', 'China', 'climate', 'in_force', '2016-01-01'::date, 'China', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/33_13', ARRAY['sdg13', 'other sustainability policy', 'regulations', 'mandatory', 'china']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('7ba89b00-7cd6-515c-b022-bdab5d899ee4', 'China Establishing the Green Financials System', 'Guidelines for Establishing the Green Financials System', 'These guidelines strive to accomplish many essential goals – they will execute the tasks of the Government Work Report, promote the sustainable development of the economy, establish a sound green financial system, improve the function of the capital market in allocating resources and servicing the real economy, and support and promote the development of an ecological civilization.', 'These guidelines strive to accomplish many essential goals – they will execute the tasks of the Government Work Report, promote the sustainable development of the economy, establish a sound green financial system, improve the function of the capital market in allocating resources and servicing the real economy, and support and promote the development of an ecological civilization.', 'These guidelines strive to accomplish many essential goals – they will execute the tasks of the Government Work Report, promote the sustainable development of the economy, establish a sound green financial system, improve the function of the capital market in allocating resources and servicing the real economy, and support and promote the development of an ecological civilization.', 'China', 'climate', 'in_force', '2016-01-01'::date, 'China', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/33_15', ARRAY['guidance_frameworks', 'sdg7', 'sdg11', 'disclosure', 'china', 'voluntary']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('9aa9ae8d-421c-5eac-bb98-4d7b142dc77c', 'China Electricity Consumption Accounting Measures for Cement Enterprises', 'Electricity Consumption Accounting Measures for Cement Enterprises', 'A measure to promote energy conservation, consumption reduction, cost reduction and efficiency enhancement of cement enterprises to achieve green development.', 'A measure to promote energy conservation, consumption reduction, cost reduction and efficiency enhancement of cement enterprises to achieve green development.', 'A measure to promote energy conservation, consumption reduction, cost reduction and efficiency enhancement of cement enterprises to achieve green development.', 'China', 'climate', 'in_force', '2016-01-01'::date, 'China', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/33_68', ARRAY['sdg7', 'china', 'mandatory', 'mandatory_regulations', 'disclosure', 'sdg9']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('4f1a74b4-6561-54f5-9ac5-1d8e414e5712', 'China Establishing the Green Financial System (关于构建绿色金融体系的指导意见)', 'Guidelines for Establishing the Green Financial System (关于构建绿色金融体系的指导意见)', 'The Guidelines for Establishing the Green Financial System, issued in 2016 by key Chinese regulatory bodies including the People’s Bank of China (PBOC), Ministry of Finance, China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC), and China Banking Regulatory Commission (CBRC), provide a comprehensive framework for integrating sustainability into China’s financial sector.

The guidelines aim to:

Mobilize private and public capital to support green industries.
Discourage investments in polluting industries.
Strengthen financial institutions'' risk management in climate and environmental issues.
Key components of the policy include:

Green Credit:
Banks must integrate environmental and social risk factors into credit decisions.
Green loans are eligible for government subsidies.
Encourages securitization of green loans to increase liquidity.
Green Bonds & Securities Market:
Mandatory disclosure requirements for corporate environmental risks.
Green bond issuance incentives, including lower financing costs.
Establishes green indices and supports green IPOs and secondary financing.
Green Insurance:
Mandatory pollution liability insurance for high-risk industries.
Expands climate risk insurance, including agriculture and forestry insurance.
Carbon & Environmental Rights Trading:
Develops a national carbon market.
Promotes financial instruments for trading carbon, water rights, and pollution quotas.
Green Development Funds:
Establishes government-backed green investment funds.
Supports Public-Private Partnerships (PPPs) for green projects.
International Green Finance Cooperation:
Encourages foreign investment in China’s green finance sector.
Promotes green finance within China’s Belt and Road Initiative (BRI).', 'The Guidelines for Establishing the Green Financial System, issued in 2016 by key Chinese regulatory bodies including the People’s Bank of China (PBOC), Ministry of Finance, China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC), and China Banking Regulatory Commission (CBRC), provide a comprehensive framework for integrating sustainability into China’s financial sector.

The guidelines aim to:

