Promotes green finance within China’s Belt and Road Initiative (BRI).', 'The Guidelines for Establishing the Green Financial System, issued in 2016 by key Chinese regulatory bodies including the People’s Bank of China (PBOC), Ministry of Finance, China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC), and China Banking Regulatory Commission (CBRC), provide a comprehensive framework for integrating sustainability into China’s financial sector.

